  <entry>
    <title>macOS下Rime输入法配置雾凇拼音</title>
    <link href="http://www.uncoverman.com/use-rime-ice-on-macOS.html"/>
    <id>http://www.uncoverman.com/use-rime-ice-on-macOS.html</id>
